                  %mi V
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V \otimes V
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+product+of+vector+spaces"} tensor product of
            a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite-dimensional+vector+space"} finite-dimensional vector space
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
