                  \\,.
          %p
            %br/
          %p
            %strong Braid representations.
            In either form, any solution to the plain Yang-Baxter equation in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vect"}
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
