            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/braid+representations"} braid representations
            actually are (factor through)
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representations+of+the+symmetric+group"} representations of the symmetric group
            = succeed "." do
