          %p
            %br/
          %h4#parameterized_form Parameterized form
          %p
            The plain form
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:PlainQuantumYBInParameterizedForm"} (3)
            of the Yang-Baxter equation generalizes to the case where
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
